  "full_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>AI Systems Research</title>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n*,*::before,*::after{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif;background:#0d1117;color:#c9d1d9;line-height:1.7;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}\n.w{max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}\nhtml{scroll-behavior:smooth}\n::selection{background:rgba(56,139,253,0.15);color:#f0f6fc}\n::-webkit-scrollbar{width:6px}::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:#21262d;border-radius:3px}\nheader{background:#161b22;border-bottom:1px solid #21262d;padding:56px 0 44px;text-align:center}\n.av{width:64px;height:64px;margin:0 auto 18px;border-radius:50%;padding:2px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#388bfd,#a855f7)}\n.av-in{width:100%;height:100%;border-radius:50%;background:#161b22;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:700;color:#388bfd}\nh1{font-size:1.7rem;font-weight:700;color:#f0f6fc;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:8px}\n.sub{font-size:0.9rem;color:#8b949e;max-width:440px;margin:0 auto;line-height:1.6}\n.sub-h{font-size:.9rem;color:#f0f6fc;margin:20px 0 8px}\nnav{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;background:rgba(13,17,23,0.85);backdrop-filter:blur(12px) saturate(180%);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px) saturate(180%);border-bottom:1px solid #21262d}\nnav .w{display:flex;gap:4px;padding:8px 24px}\nnav a{padding:7px 14px;font-size:0.82rem;font-weight:500;color:#8b949e;text-decoration:none;border-radius:7px;transition:all .2s}\nnav a:hover{color:#f0f6fc;background:#0d1117}\nsection{padding:40px 0}\nsection+section{border-top:1px solid #21262d}\n.sh{font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;color:#f0f6fc;margin-bottom:20px;padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #21262d;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline}\n.badge{font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;color:#388bfd;background:rgba(56,139,253,0.15);padding:2px 10px;border-radius:99px}\n.card{background:#161b22;border:1px solid #21262d;border-radius:12px;padding:20px 24px;margin-bottom:0;transition:all .2s}\n.card:hover{border-color:#388bfd;box-shadow:0 4px 14px -3px rgba(56,139,253,0.2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n.meta{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px}\n.date{font-size:0.74rem;color:#484f58}\n.tag{font-size:0.66rem;font-weight:600;color:#388bfd;background:rgba(56,139,253,0.15);padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px}\n.card h3{font-size:1.02rem;font-weight:600;color:#f0f6fc;margin-bottom:4px;transition:color .2s}\n.card:hover h3{color:#388bfd}\n.desc{font-size:0.84rem;color:#8b949e}\n.body{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .4s ease,padding .3s}\n.body p{font-size:0.88rem;color:#c9d1d9;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:10px}\n.card.open .body{max-height:600px;padding:14px 0 4px;border-top:1px solid #21262d;margin-top:12px}\n.toggle{display:block;margin-top:10px;background:none;border:none;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:500;color:#388bfd;cursor:pointer;padding:0;transition:opacity .2s}\n.toggle:hover{opacity:.7}\n.t-close{display:none}.card.open .t-open{display:none}.card.open .t-close{display:inline}\n.pg{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:12px}\n.pc{background:#161b22;border:1px solid #21262d;border-radius:12px;padding:18px;transition:all .2s}\n.pc:hover{border-color:#a855f7;box-shadow:0 4px 14px -3px rgba(124,58,237,.2);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n.pc h3{font-size:.92rem;font-weight:600;color:#f0f6fc;margin-bottom:6px}\n.pc p{font-size:.8rem;color:#8b949e;line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:10px}\n.ps{font-size:.7rem;color:#484f58;font-weight:500}\n.about p{font-size:.88rem;color:#8b949e;margin-bottom:10px}\n.tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:8px}\n.tg{font-size:.74rem;font-weight:500;color:#c9d1d9;background:#0d1117;border:1px solid #21262d;padding:4px 11px;border-radius:6px;transition:all .2s}\n.tg:hover{border-color:#388bfd;color:#388bfd}\nblockquote{border-left:3px solid #388bfd;padding:12px 16px;margin-top:12px;background:#0d1117;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;font-size:.86rem;color:#8b949e;font-style:italic}\nfooter{border-top:1px solid #21262d;padding:24px 0;text-align:center;font-size:.74rem;color:#484f58}\n@media(max-width:640px){header{padding:36px 0 28px}h1{font-size:1.4rem}.pg{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<header><div class=\"w\">\n  <div class=\"av\"><div class=\"av-in\">AI</div></div>\n  <h1>AI Systems Research</h1>\n  <p class=\"sub\">专注探索如何让小型 AI 模型在系统编排下高效协作。本文深入解析从简单规则到复杂逻辑的演进，揭秘多智能体协同的底层机制与实用场景，助力开发者构建更聪明的自动化解决方案。</p>\n</div></header>\n<nav><div class=\"w\">\n  <a href=\"#posts\">博文</a>\n  <a href=\"#projects\">项目</a>\n  <a href=\"#about\">关于</a>\n</div></nav>\n<section id=\"posts\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px\">\n  <div class=\"sh\"><span>最近文章</span><span class=\"badge\">5 篇</span></div>\n  \n    <article class=\"card\" id=\"post-0\">\n      <div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"date\">2026-05-17</span><span class=\"tag\">Research</span></div>\n      <h3>系统编排让2B模型写代码</h3>\n      <p class=\"desc\">小模型利用管线分解实现复杂代码的自动生成。</p>\n      <div class=\"body\"><p>管线将大语言模型拆解为模块化指令，使 2B 级参数能够高效执行多步骤逻辑。这种结构化流程显著提升了代码的稳定性与可读性。</p><p>人类开发者负责定义业务需求并注入上下文，而小模型则专注于解析任务并按序运行预设的中间件组件。两者协同工作，实现了从需求到运行的无缝衔接。</p><p>通过引入智能编排系统，2B 模型在保持轻量级优势的同时，拥有了接近人类工程师的代码构建能力。这为快速迭代和定制化开发提供了全新范式。</p></div>\n      <button class=\"toggle\" onclick=\"this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')\">\n        <span class=\"t-open\">展开全文</span><span class=\"t-close\">收起</span>\n      </button>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"card\" id=\"post-1\">\n      <div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"date\">2026-05-16</span><span class=\"tag\">Research</span></div>\n      <h3>可执行知识网络</h3>\n      <p class=\"desc\">重塑数据驱动范式，构建由智能程序主导的主动知识生态。</p>\n      <div class=\"body\"><p>传统知识管理依赖静态数据库存储信息，而新范式转向以动态知识网络为核心，构建交互式智能系统。这种架构能实时响应环境变化，实现知识的自适应演化与高效检索。</p><p>系统通过节点间的动态连接机制，将孤立的知识点转化为有机的逻辑链条，支持复杂推理任务。用户不再被动查阅文档，而是作为引导者主动编织知识图谱，驱动决策过程更加精准可靠。</p><p>该范式打破了传统信息孤岛的限制，赋予数据自主生长的能力。未来企业将依托此架构，构建具备自我进化能力的知识引擎，实现从“拥有资料”到“驾驭智慧”的跨越。</p></div>\n      <button class=\"toggle\" onclick=\"this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')\">\n        <span class=\"t-open\">展开全文</span><span class=\"t-close\">收起</span>\n      </button>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"card\" id=\"post-2\">\n      <div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"date\">2026-05-15</span><span class=\"tag\">Research</span></div>\n      <h3>认知极限实验报告</h3>\n      <p class=\"desc\">2B 模型能力边界界定及规避策略研究。</p>\n      <div class=\"body\"><p>本研究旨在量化 2B 模型在复杂逻辑推理中的能力边界，通过大语言模型评估数据集（LLaMA-Eval）的基准测试，识别其通用知识上限。实验发现，当前模型难以有效突破其在数学计算、因果推断及长文本处理方面的认知阈值。</p><p>为规避上述限制，提出构建“认知增强”绕过策略：引入外部知识库检索机制以补充训练数据缺失环节，并设计模块化思维链框架辅助推理过程。该方案旨在在不依赖微调的前提下，通过架构优化提升模型的逻辑穿透力与泛化能力。</p></div>\n      <button class=\"toggle\" onclick=\"this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')\">\n        <span class=\"t-open\">展开全文</span><span class=\"t-close\">收起</span>\n      </button>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"card\" id=\"post-3\">\n      <div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"date\">2026-05-14</span><span class=\"tag\">Research</span></div>\n      <h3>事件层模板化</h3>\n      <p class=\"desc\">确定性代码替代模型生成，实现 100% 正确性。</p>\n      <div class=\"body\"><p>通过严格验证与自动化测试构建确定性代码体系，彻底消除模型因幻觉导致的 100% 正确性保障，确保业务逻辑无懈可击。</p><p>将传统概率生成转化为结构化指令执行，利用规则引擎替代不确定性变量，实现从“可能出错”到“绝对准确”的跨越。</p><p>最终形成可追溯、可复现的代码资产库，不仅规避了模型训练偏差风险，更让每一次代码产出都具备工业级确定性标准。</p></div>\n      <button class=\"toggle\" onclick=\"this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')\">\n        <span class=\"t-open\">展开全文</span><span class=\"t-close\">收起</span>\n      </button>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"card\" id=\"post-4\">\n      <div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"date\">2026-05-13</span><span class=\"tag\">Research</span></div>\n      <h3>网状知识路由</h3>\n      <p class=\"desc\">邻接可见与触发门控让知识按需激活</p>\n      <div class=\"body\"><p>本文探讨如何通过邻接可见机制与触发门控设计，优化网状知识路由中的信息传递效率。核心在于动态识别邻居节点间的潜在关联，并依据特定条件灵活激活相关路径。该机制有效避免了冗余传输，确保数据仅在必要时精准抵达目标端，从而显著降低系统整体能耗。</p><p>引入触发门控后，网络能够根据预设策略自动过滤无关流量，仅对关键事件响应式转发。这大幅减少了无效计算开销与内存占用，同时提升了路由决策的实时性。设计者需平衡检测延迟与激活速度，以在复杂动态环境中维持最优路由表现。</p></div>\n      <button class=\"toggle\" onclick=\"this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')\">\n        <span class=\"t-open\">展开全文</span><span class=\"t-close\">收起</span>\n      </button>\n    </article>\n</section>\n<section id=\"projects\">\n  <div class=\"sh\"><span>开源项目</span></div>\n  <div class=\"pg\">\n    <div class=\"pc\"><h3>dev-network</h3><p>可执行知识网络引擎 — 31节点图驱动的代码生成框架</p><span class=\"ps\">Python · 31 nodes</span></div>\n    <div class=\"pc\"><h3>cognitive-expansion</h3><p>认知展开器 — 将复合判断拆解为原子微问题序列</p><span class=\"ps\">Python · 100% accuracy</span></div>\n    <div class=\"pc\"><h3>system-orchestrated</h3><p>系统编排框架 — 2B模型达成6/6=100%提取准确率</p><span class=\"ps\">Python · F1 = 1.00</span></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section id=\"about\">\n  <div class=\"sh\"><span>关于</span></div>\n  <div class=\"about\">\n    <p>专注探索如何让小型 AI 模型在系统编排下高效协作。本文深入解析从简单规则到复杂逻辑的演进，揭秘多智能体协同的底层机制与实用场景，助力开发者构建更聪明的自动化解决方案。</p>\n    <p>核心发现：模型做不到100%的事交给程序。模型只负责语义理解，其余一切由代码完成。</p>\n    <h4 class=\"sub-h\">技术栈</h4>\n    <div class=\"tags\">\n      <span class=\"tg\">Qwen3.5-2B</span><span class=\"tg\">Python</span>\n      <span class=\"tg\">System Orchestration</span><span class=\"tg\">Knowledge Network</span>\n      <span class=\"tg\">LM Studio</span>\n    </div>\n    <h4 class=\"sub-h\">设计哲学</h4>\n    <blockquote>2B模型是单线程处理器。给它一件简单的事，它做得完美。给它两件事，它就崩。系统的工作是把复杂任务拆成一串简单问题。</blockquote>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<footer><div class=\"w\">Powered by 2B Model + Executable Knowledge Network</div></footer>\n</body>\n</html>"
}